Third-party assets used by this project
=======================================

Salamander Grand Piano
----------------------
Yamaha C5 grand piano samples by Alexander Holm.
Licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 Unported (CC-BY 3.0).
https://archive.org/details/SalamanderGrandPianoV3

Downloaded on demand into ~/.cache/earworms/samples/salamander/ and used as the
lead instrument in the generated music bed. Samples are not redistributed with
this repository.

VSCO 2 Community Edition
------------------------
Orchestral samples recorded by Sam Gossner and Simon Dalzell, with sample
cutting by Elan Hickler/Soundemote. Dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0.
https://github.com/sgossner/VSCO-2-CE

Curated strings, marimba and glockenspiel samples are downloaded on demand into
~/.cache/earworms/samples/. They are not redistributed with this repository.

